<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post5417948151112085116..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: It Won&#39;t Stay in Vegas: The Metro PD&#39;s Homeland Security Theater</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5417948151112085116/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/it-wont-stay-in-vegas-metro-pds.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>8</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6609194997914105508</id><published>2013-10-02T14:20:08.957-06:00</published><updated>2013-10-02T14:20:08.957-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;#39;... arrested for selling water on the Strip.&amp;...</title><content type='html'>&amp;#39;... arrested for selling water on the Strip.&amp;#39;  Imagine daring to sell water in 110 degree weather without the official city and county licenses! I&amp;#39;ll bet he also neglected to collect the sales tax... horror of horrors. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Americans are now afraid of their own shadows. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;#39;Hey, look - Muslim terrorists who want to kill you! And over there - look! Sovereign citizens who hate America! They too want to kill you!&amp;#39; And the boobs believe the propaganda.... meanwhile those who are actually committing acts of terror worldwide and others who kill folks on America&amp;#39;s streets are repeatedly ignored. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;___________&lt;br /&gt;Will, would you care to include a mailing address below for those of us who&amp;#39;d like to send a check?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5417948151112085116/comments/default/6609194997914105508'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5417948151112085116/comments/default/6609194997914105508'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/it-wont-stay-in-vegas-metro-pds.html?showComment=1380745208957#c6609194997914105508' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/it-wont-stay-in-vegas-metro-pds.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5417948151112085116' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5417948151112085116' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-729996957"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 2, 2013 at 2:20 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-548091492230755245</id><published>2013-10-02T07:00:09.141-06:00</published><updated>2013-10-02T07:00:09.141-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Brutsche&amp;#39;s background prior to his involve...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Brutsche&amp;#39;s background prior to his involvement with Metro&amp;#39;s Homeland Security Theater troupe demonstrates that he&amp;#39;s not a responsible person. That background is also why he was so valuable to them. People who stage theatrical exercises of the kind arranged by Majewski are very good at talent-scouting patsies. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;There is no evidence that Brutsche contributed anything to this &amp;quot;plot&amp;quot; but his own credulousness. And it&amp;#39;s worth underscoring the fact that Metro&amp;#39;s false flag op, like those run by the FBI against Muslims, played on a sense of entirely defensible outrage over criminal behavior by state agents, rather than a desire for illicit personal enrichment or a private vendetta. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The people who orchestrate these operations &lt;i&gt;know&lt;/i&gt; that the government employing them commits criminal violence against the innocent -- and that what they&amp;#39;re doing is meant to manipulate, rather than protect, the public. This is why their criminal conduct is immeasurably worse than that of Brutsche or the other gullible people featured in Homeland Security Theater productions.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5417948151112085116/comments/default/548091492230755245'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5417948151112085116/comments/default/548091492230755245'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/it-wont-stay-in-vegas-metro-pds.html?showComment=1380718809141#c548091492230755245' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='22' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-Ol6GVktahVU/UhwPgHyhnNI/AAAAAAAAJeQ/ik4eBjgEKPs/s220/New%2BHeadshot.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/it-wont-stay-in-vegas-metro-pds.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5417948151112085116' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5417948151112085116' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 2, 2013 at 7:00 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7748666269361339612</id><published>2013-10-02T03:29:51.347-06:00</published><updated>2013-10-02T03:29:51.347-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I&amp;#39;m hardly inclined to think well of state age...</title><content type='html'>I&amp;#39;m hardly inclined to think well of state agents, but while the man may have been manipulated, the fact remains that he was willing to continue meeting with people who he had every reason to believe were planning murder.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;That&amp;#39;s hardly the action of a responsible person.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5417948151112085116/comments/default/7748666269361339612'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5417948151112085116/comments/default/7748666269361339612'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/it-wont-stay-in-vegas-metro-pds.html?showComment=1380706191347#c7748666269361339612' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0'