l'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-694854019"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 30, 2013 at 11:13 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-283713501661884031</id><published>2013-09-30T00:30:00.531-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-30T00:30:00.531-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Btw, great article as always.  I would love to dow...</title><content type='html'>Btw, great article as always.  I would love to download podcasts of your radio show.  Is that possible, or just listening live?  I hate you are in financial shape you are in for speaking the truth, and hope you can get something soon.  I donated what I can and hope others do the same.  </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5417948151112085116/comments/default/283713501661884031'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5417948151112085116/comments/default/283713501661884031'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/it-wont-stay-in-vegas-metro-pds.html?showComment=1380522600531#c283713501661884031' title=''/><link rel='related' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5417948151112085116/comments/default/401828699693823987'/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/it-wont-stay-in-vegas-metro-pds.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5417948151112085116' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5417948151112085116' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-694854019"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.disp